    "paragraphs": [
      "<p>Students at the University of North Carolina - Greensboro benefit from the warm, encouraging nature of their teaching and the expert knowledge of their staff.&nbsp;</p><p>With a variety of exceptional facilities - including a well-recognised library system - there's plenty to support your studies.&nbsp;</p><p>Moreover, students can be part of a diverse and bustling co-curricular system which boasts not only a broad sports programme and arts scheme but also a thriving Greek Life community.&nbsp;</p><p>With over 20 Sororities and Fraternities, there's something for everyone.</p>"
